  '61fccb37-41d2-54e5-93dc-65170c970890', '773d8b95-845a-571a-a1f7-957c916a788a',
  '[L.O.1.2] Please indicate the screen output of the following program:

```cpp
int cnt = 0;
int foo(int n){
    if(n == 0)      return 0;
    return n % 10 + foo(n/10);
}
