INSERT INTO question_bank_2_examples (id, group_id, content, sequence)
VALUES (
  'b8d11ef2-f796-5845-bb14-ef51126affd1', '773d8b95-845a-571a-a1f7-957c916a788a',
  '[L.O.3.2] Given Straight insertion sort:

```c
void insertionSort(int arr[], int array_size){
    int i, j, value;
    for (i = 1; i < array_size; i++){
        value = arr[i];
        j = i;
        while (________){
            arr[j] = arr[j - 1];
            j = j - 1;
        }
        arr[j] = value;
    }
}
```

Which of the following answer is correct fill of the blank (_______)?

Lựa chọn:
- (j > 0) || (arr[j - 1] > value)
- (j > 0) && (arr[j - 1] > value)
- (j > 0) && (arr[j + 1] > value)
- (j > 0) && (arr[j + 1] < value)', 37
);

