  'a8c4d887-15e2-5667-b811-872da464ce8c', '773d8b95-845a-571a-a1f7-957c916a788a',
  '[L.O.2.1] In a doubly linked list with a number of nodes greater than 10, suppose $p$ points to a node in the list (this node is neither the first nor the last node). To insert node $q$ before node $p$, which group of statements below is chosen?

Lựa chọn:
