VALUES (
  '74018ab4-8ad2-5040-b841-78277b6a2595', '773d8b95-845a-571a-a1f7-957c916a788a',
  '[L.O.3.3] Using Quicksort to sort the following numbers (28, 16, 32, 12, 60, 2, 5, 72) in ascending order, what is the result of the first partition, given the function `Partition`?

```c
void Partition(int arr[], int low, int high){
    int left = low, right = high, pivot_item = arr[low];
    while(left <= right){
        while(arr[left] <= pivot_item) left++;
        while(arr[right] > pivot_item) right--;
        if(left < right) swap(arr[left], arr[right]);
    }
    arr[low] = arr[right];
    arr[right] = pivot_item;
}
```

Lựa chọn:
- (2,5,12,16)28(60,32,72)
- (5,16,2,12)28(60,32,72)
- (2,16,5,12)28(60,32,72)
- (5,16,12,2)28(32,60,72)', 73
);

